e to the extract from The Life and Crimes of", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.4662004662004662, "x1": 0.8835164835164835, "y1": 0.4794094794094794}, {"text": "Harry Lavender and the novel as a whole.", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.4825174825174825, "x1": 0.5076923076923077, "y1": 0.49572649572649574}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4846153846153846, "y0": 0.8624708624708625, "x1": 0.5142857142857142, "y1": 0.8733488733488733}, {"text": "Question 3 continues on page 6", "x0": 0.3659340659340659, "y0": 0.9044289044289044, "x1": 0.6329670329670329, "y1": 0.9176379176379177}], [{"text": "Question 3 (continued)", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.3054945054945055, "y1": 0.0947940947940948}, {"text": "(b)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.14175824175824175, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "Mark Haddon, The Curious Incident of the Dog in the Night-time", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.7230769230769231, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "The complexity of human relationships is central to The Curious Incident of the Dog in", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text": "the Night-time.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.1655011655011655, "x1": 0.2868131868131868, "y1": 0.17871017871017872}, {"text": "To what extent do you agree with this statement?", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.1989121989121989, "x1": 0.5659340659340659, "y1": 0.21212121212121213}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to the extract from The Curious Incident of the", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "Dog in the Night-time and the novel as a whole.", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.24864024864024864, "x1": 0.554945054945055, "y1": 0.2618492618492618}, {"text": "End of Question 3", "x0": 0.4208791208791209, "y0": 0.5959595959595959, "x1": 0.5769230769230769, "y1": 0.6091686091686092}], [{"text": "Question 4 \u2014 Drama (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.3967032967032967, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "Scott Rankin, Namatjira", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.37362637362637363, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "(a)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11577311577311578, "x1": 0.14065934065934066, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "The complexity of human relationships is central to Namatjira.", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.6780219780219781, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text": "To what extent do you agree with this statement?", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.18181818181818182, "x1": 0.5659340659340659, "y1": 0.19502719502719504}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to the extract from Namatjira and the play as", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "a whole.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.23232323232323232, "x1": 0.23406593406593407, "y1": 0.24164724164724163}, {"text": "Trevor: So there was Albert, between two worlds. Name changed.", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.7714285714285715, "y1": 0.27816627816627815}, {"text": "Not a man, not a boy. Following his heart western way,", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.28205128205128205, "x1": 0.7714285714285715, "y1": 0.29526029526029524}, {"text": "wrong-way marriage. Speaking Aranda, German, bit of", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.29836829836829837, "x1": 0.7736263736263737, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "English. He\u2019s an evangelist, choir, bushman. Growing", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.31546231546231546, "x1": 0.7725274725274726, "y1": 0.32867132867132864}, {"text": "family, poor, no house, nothing. My, hasn\u2019t the world", "x0": 0.3032967032967033, "y0": 0.3317793317793318, "x1": 0.7725274725274726, "y1": 0.34498834498834496}, {"text": "changed?", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.34965034965034963, "x1": 0.3769230769230769, "y1": 0.3620823620823621}, {"text": "A Model T Ford arrives.", "x0": 0.33516483516483514, "y0": 0.3752913752913753, "x1": 0.532967032967033, "y1": 0.3853923853923854}, {"text": "Then one day into the mission comes this angry mechanical", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.4017094017094017, "x1": 0.7725274725274726, "y1": 0.4149184149184149}, {"text": "ant. And from its belly climbs this strange little man ...", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.4188034188034188, "x1": 0.7714285714285715, "y1": 0.432012432012432}, {"text": "and he walks funny, like a bird.", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.43512043512043513, "x1": 0.5571428571428572, "y1": 0.4483294483294483}, {"text": "Mission MEN gather, aroused, whispering.", "x0": 0.33516483516483514, "y0": 0.46231546231546233, "x1": 0.6725274725274726, "y1": 0.4755244755244755}, {"text": "Man:", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.48951048951048953, "x1": 0.2692307692307692, "y1": 0.4988344988344988}, {"text": "Aiyua untjwarra era pitjika/", "x0": 0.3010989010989011, "y0": 0.48951048951048953, "x1": 0.5318681318681319, "y1": 0.5019425019425019}, {"text": "Man:", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.5167055167055167, "x1": 0.2692307692307692, "y1": 0.526029526029526}, {"text": "Alte reiher mann ist gekommen/", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.5167055167055167, "x1": 0.5648351648351648, "y1": 0.5291375291375291}, {"text": "Man:", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.5431235431235432, "x1": 0.2692307692307692, "y1": 0.5524475524475524}, {"text": "Aiyua untjwarra era pitjika/", "x0": 0.3010989010989011, "y0": 0.5431235431235432, "x1": 0.5318681318681319, "y1": 0.5555555555555556}, {"text": "Man:", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.5703185703185704, "x1": 0.2692307692307692, "y1": 0.5796425796425796}, {"text": "Old Heron Man has come.", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.5703185703185704, "x1": 0.5153846153846153, "y1": 0.5796425796425796}, {"text": "Rex steps from the car, moving like a heron.", "x0": 0.33516483516483514, "y0": 0.5959595959595959, "x1": 0.6934065934065934, "y1": 0.6091686091686092}, {"text": "\u2018Namatjra by Scott Rankin, first published by Currency Press in 2011", "x0": 0.3637362637362637, "y0": 0.6433566433566433, "x1": 0.7670329670329671, "y1": 0.6526806526806527}, {"text": "Reproduced with the permission of the publisher.", "x0": 0.4835164835164835, "y0": 0.6542346542346542, "x1": 0.7692307692307693, "y1": 0.6635586635586636}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4846153846153846, "y0": 0.7373737373737373, "x1": 0.5142857142857142, "y1": 0.7474747474747475}, {"text": "Question 4 continues on page 8", "x0": 0.3659340659340659, "y0": 0.7793317793317793, "x1": 0.6329670329670329, "y1": 0.7925407925407926}, {"text": "-7- stp", "x0": 0.47912087912087914, "y0": 0.9471639471639471, "x1": 0.9142857142857143, "y1": 0.9526029526029526}], [{"text": "Question 4 (continued)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "William Shakespeare, The Merchant of Venice", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.5637362637362637, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "(b)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11577311577311578, "x1": 0.14175824175824175, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "The complexity of human relationships is central to The Merchant of Venice.", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.7901098901098901, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text": "To what extent do you agree with this statement?", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.18181818181818182, "x1": 0.5659340659340659, "y1": 0.19502719502719504}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to the extract from The Merchant of Venice", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "and the play as a whole.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.23232323232323232, "x1": 0.36153846153846153, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "[Arragon unlocks the silver casket]", "x0": 0.35604395604395606, "y0": 0.28205128205128205, "x1": 0.6428571428571429, "y1": 0.29526029526029524}, {"text": "Portia Too long a pause for that which you find there.", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.3014763014763015, "x1": 0.7241758241758242, "y1": 0.3247863247863248}, {"text": "ARRAGON here? The portrait of a blinking idiot.", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.3185703185703186, "x1": 0.7065934065934066, "y1": 0.3418803418803419}, {"text": "Presenting me a schedule! I will read it.", "x0": 0.34285714285714286, "y0": 0.3418803418803419, "x1": 0.6637362637362637, "y1": 0.3550893550893551}, {"text": "How much unlike art thou to Portia!", "x0": 0.34285714285714286, "y0": 0.358974358974359, "x1": 0.6351648351648351, "y1": 0.3690753690753691}, {"text": "How much unlike my hopes and my deservings.", "x0": 0.34285714285714286, "y0": 0.3752913752913753, "x1": 0.7329670329670329, "y1": 0.3885003885003885}, {"text": "\u2018Who chooseth me, shall have as much as he deserves.\u2019", "x0": 0.34395604395604396, "y0": 0.3916083916083916, "x1": 0.7912087912087912, "y1": 0.4024864024864025}, {"text": "Did I deserve no more than a fool\u2019s head?", "x0": 0.34285714285714286, "y0": 0.4087024087024087, "x1": 0.6835164835164835, "y1": 0.4188034188034188}, {"text": "Is that my prize? Are my deserts no better?", "x0": 0.34285714285714286, "y0": 0.425019425019425, "x1": 0.6923076923076923, "y1": 0.4382284382284382}, {"text": "Portia To offend and judge are distinct offices,", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.4421134421134421, "x1": 0.667032967032967, "y1": 0.4553224553224553}, {"text": "And of opposed natures.", "x0": 0.34285714285714286, "y0": 0.45843045843045843, "x1": 0.5395604395604395, "y1": 0.4716394716394716}, {"text": "End of Question 4", "x0": 0.421978021978022, "y0": 0.5361305361305362, "x1": 0.5769230769230769, "y1": 0.5485625485625486}, {"text": "stp", "x0": 0.08461538461538462, "y0": 0.9471639471639471, "x1": 0.1054945054945055, "y1": 0.9526029526029526}], [{"text": "Question 5 \u2014 Poetry (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.3934065934065934, "y1": 0.0947940947940948}, {"text": "(a) Oodgeroo Noonuceal, Selected Poems", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.4857142857142857, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "The complexity of human relationships is central to the poetry of Oodgeroo Noonuccal.", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text": "To what extent do you agree with this statement?", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.18181818181818182, "x1": 0.5659340659340659, "y1": 0.19502719502719504}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to the extract from Reed Flute Cave and ONE", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "other poem set for study.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.36813186813186816, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.4483294483294483, "x1": 0.3791208791208791, "y1": 0.46153846153846156}, {"text": "= Oodgeroo Noonuccal, Selected Poems", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.4716394716394716, "x1": 0.5, "y1": 0.48484848484848486}, {"text": "* Municipal Gum", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.494949494949495, "x1": 0.34065934065934067, "y1": 0.5081585081585082}, {"text": "ee RR RE", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5120435120435121, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.6013986013986014}, {"text": "Artist Son", "x0": 0.21318681318681318, "y0": 0.5128205128205128, "x1": 0.2934065934065934, "y1": 0.5229215229215229}, {"text": "The Past", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.5283605283605284, "x1": 0.2857142857142857, "y1": 0.5384615384615384}, {"text": "China ... Woman", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.5454545454545454, "x1": 0.35494505494505496, "y1": 0.5563325563325563}, {"text": "Reed Flute Cave", "x0": 0.21318681318681318, "y0": 0.5617715617715617, "x1": 0.34945054945054943, "y1": 0.5726495726495726}, {"text": "Entombed Warriors", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.5788655788655789, "x1": 0.3747252747252747, "y1": 0.5889665889665889}, {"text": "Visit to Sun Yat-Sen Memorial Hall", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.5951825951825952, "x1": 0.5021978021978022, "y1": 0.6060606060606061}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4846153846153846, "y0": 0.6371406371406372, "x1": 0.5142857142857142, "y1": 0.6480186480186481}, {"text": "Question 5 continues on page 10", "x0": 0.36043956043956044, "y0": 0.7296037296037297, "x1": 0.6384615384615384, "y1": 0.7428127428127428}], [{"text": "Question 5 (continued)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "(b) Wilfred Owen, Wilfred Owen: War Poems and Others", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.621978021978022, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "The complexity of human relationships is central to the poetry of Wilfred Owen.", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.8208791208791208, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text": "To what extent do you agree with this statement?", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.18181818181818182, "x1": 0.5659340659340659, "y1": 0.19502719502719504}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to the extract from Jnsensibility and ONE other", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "poem set for study.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.3208791208791209, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "Happy are men who yet before they are killed", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.26495726495726496, "x1": 0.6813186813186813, "y1": 0.27816627816627815}, {"text": "Can let their veins run cold.", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.28205128205128205, "x1": 0.5340659340659341, "y1": 0.29215229215229216}, {"text": "Whom no compassion fleers", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.29836829836829837, "x1": 0.5395604395604395, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "Or makes their feet", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.31546231546231546, "x1": 0.46483516483516485, "y1": 0.32556332556332557}, {"text": "Sore on the alleys cobbled with their brothers.", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.33255633255633255, "x1": 0.6824175824175824, "y1": 0.34498834498834496}, {"text": "The front line withers.", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.34887334887334887, "x1": 0.489010989010989, "y1": 0.358974358974359}, {"text": "But they are troops who fade, not flowers,", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.3651903651903652, "x1": 0.6516483516483517, "y1": 0.37839937839937837}, {"text": "For poets\u2019 tearful fooling:", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.3815073815073815, "x1": 0.5175824175824176, "y1": 0.3947163947163947}, {"text": "Men, gaps for filling:", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.3986013986013986, "x1": 0.48131868131868133, "y1": 0.41181041181041184}, {"text": "Losses, who might have fought", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.4149184149184149, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.4281274281274281}, {"text": "Longer; but no one bothers.", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.43278943278943277, "x1": 0.532967032967033, "y1": 0.44522144522144524}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.4662004662004662, "x1": 0.3791208791208791, "y1": 0.47863247863247865}, {"text": "Wilfred Owen, Wilfred Owen: War Poems and Others", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.4887334887334887, "x1": 0.6318681318681318, "y1": 0.5019425019425019}, {"text": "The Next War", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.5128205128205128, "x1": 0.3274725274725275, "y1": 0.5221445221445221}, {"text": "ee RR RR", "x0": 0.1912087912087